raphics at all. As time progressed, though, ports to more advanced systems were enhanced with visuals.", "summary": "A text based Adventure Game for the TRS-80, later enhanced with visual scenes in various ports. Only allowed 2-Word input and was largely based on Colossal Cave Adventure.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/adventureland", "collections": [{"id": 2111, "name": "Scott Adams Classic Adventures"}]}